# SOLID

Full reference: [`.agents/rules/solid.md`](../../.agents/rules/solid.md).

| Letter | Repo rule |
|--------|-----------|
| **S** | Routes ≠ auth ≠ DB ≠ models |
| **O** | Add route/lib modules; avoid editing `clerk.py`/`db.py` per feature |
| **I** | Depend on `ClerkIdentityDep` + `get_session` |
| **D** | Libs never import routes |

```text
✅ route → Depends → lib → models
❌ route → Clerk + Engine + SQL + business rules
```

If Clerk changes and a non-auth file must change, SRP was violated.
